(25, $t$4 required essays: the activity you have been most engaged in 250 words + an experience with someone of a different perspective 250 words (new) + personal/creative essay 650 words + school-specific essay 500 words. Submit via the Common App or Georgetown's own application.$t$, $t$Starting with the 2026-27 cycle (Fall 2027 entry), adopted the Common App for the first time and overhauled the supplement — new 250-word 'encounter with a different perspective' essay, previous talents prompt dropped, and word limits specified instead of 'one page'.$t$, null),
