(59, $t$School-specific supplemental essay not required. 1 optional Writing Supplement may be submitted via the Common App — the official application steps state 'Submit a Writing Supplement (Optional on Common App)'; no penalty for not submitting (word count not listed on the official page). Common App personal essay is submitted.$t$, null, $t$Presidential Academic Scholarship (automatic consideration); You Are Welcome Here Scholarship (international, application required); Davis UWC Scholars partnership (need-based, up to full tuition & fees)$t$),
